  "description": "\"You're the one who said it, Lee-young. That you wanted a family.\"\n\nIn Lee-young's world, parents simply didn't exist. But stepping out of the orphanage into the real world, she realized most people took parents for granted.\n\nLee-young was curious. What would it feel like to have an adult who unconditionally rooted for and supported her?\n\nThat's why she made that call. Just for a single day, she wanted to feel the warmth of a family.\n\n\"I'll be your uncle, and I'll make you a family. So shh, that's a good girl, our Lee-young.\"\n\n\"Ngh, y-yeah...\"\n\n\"That's right, be a good girl and swallow mister's cum. Okay?\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002483)",
